  "instructions": {
    "text_instructions": [
      {
        "id": "01f19992ea691c8e919b84df190b1879",
        "content": [
          "  Context: Book-Crossing dataset (BookCrossing.com crawl, Aug-Sep 2004).\n",
          "  1.15M interactions, 308k books. Catalog enriched from Open Library.\n",
          "\n",
          "  Rules:\n",
          "  - Rating 0 means an implicit interaction (user logged the book without\n",
          "    grading it) - it is NOT a grade. All views already handle this:\n",
          "    ratings_cnt / avg_rating / weighted_rating use explicit grades (1-10)\n",
          "    only; readers_total counts ALL interactions including implicit.\n",
          "  - \"Best / top rated\" questions: rank by weighted_rating (Bayesian average,\n",
          "    m=25). Recommend a threshold ratings_cnt >= 25 for books and authors.\n",
          "  - \"Most popular / most read\" questions: rank by readers_total in v_books.\n",
          "  - \"Period / year\" questions: year_of_publication = PUBLICATION year of the\n",
          "    edition (1450-2004; the crawl ended Sep 2004). Ratings have no timestamps.\n",
          "  - Genres (v_books_by_genre) exist only for the subset enriched from Open\n",
          "    Library; a book typically has multiple genres.\n",
          "  - Authors are normalized name strings, not resolved identities - the same\n",
          "    person may appear under different spellings.\n",
          "  - Old publication years look better due to survivorship bias - mention it\n",
          "    when asked about rating trends over years."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}